Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### ============ T7b / 5.6 freeze: competing-offer actions blocked during negotiation ============
# While the land is UnderContract (offer 13 under active negotiation), competing offers keep
# their status and history but are frozen. All of the following return 409 and mutate nothing
# (driver S5-53a..S5-53i):
#   - competing landlord counter   -> POST /api/offers/14/counter-offer   (409)
#   - competing landlord accept    -> POST /api/offers/14/accept          (409)
#   - competing landlord reject    -> POST /api/offers/14/reject          (409)
#   - competing investor withdraw  -> POST /api/offers/14/withdraw        (409)
#   - competing admin reject       -> POST /api/offers/15/admin-reject    (409)
#   - competing admin approve      -> POST /api/offers/15/admin-approve   (409)
#   - competitor statuses unchanged: 14 = 1 (PendingLandlordResponse), 15 = 3 (PendingAdminApproval)
#   - no OFFER_NEGOTIATION_HISTORY rows written for 14/15 by the blocked calls
#   - the selected offer 13 stays readable by its party (200) and is not blocked
# Closing competitors is a Step 6 integration (contract -> ContractStatus.Active); not implemented.

### ============ T8 / 5.6 reservation + ExpiresAt ============

#   SELECT OFFER_ID, RESERVATION_TYPE, RESERVED_MW, EXPIRES_AT,
#          CASE WHEN RELEASED_AT IS NULL THEN 'ACTIVE' ELSE 'RELEASED' END
#   FROM GRID_CAPACITY_RESERVATIONS WHERE OFFER_ID = 13;
# Result (Offer|2.00|2027-01-09 22:33:34|ACTIVE):
#   PASS - ReservationType='Offer', ReservedMw=RequiredCapacityMw, ReleasedAt NULL
#   (driver S5-48). ExpiresAt = approval time + Grid:HoldDays (configuration default 90):
#   DATEDIFF(day, GETUTCDATE(), EXPIRES_AT) = 90 (driver S5-48b). appsettings.json:
#   "Grid": { "HoldDays": 90 }.

