### ============ T14 / 5.9 parallel admin approval ============

# docs/tests/scripts/parallel-approval.ps1 fires two admin-approve POSTs concurrently
# (in-process HttpClient tasks, real overlapping HTTP, normal Bearer auth) at
# two different 6 MW offers on a FRESH 10 MW grid (run stamp 014108617:
# grid 10, lands 201/202, offers 30/31). Final result (7 PASS / 0 FAIL):
#   PASS  exactly one approval 200 and one 409       (act=200 409)
#   PASS  active reserved capacity = 6 MW (> 10 never) (act=6.00)
#   PASS  exactly one Accepted(4) and one PendingAdminApproval(3) (act=1|1)
#   PASS  winner land UnderContract(5), loser land Verified(3)    (act=1|1)
#   PASS  loser offer has no reservation                          (act=0)
#   PASS  winner reservation not expired and has future ExpiresAt (act=0)
# Evidence available in the DB (grid 10, offers 30/31, reservation OFFER_ID=30).
# Fixtures are intentionally NOT cleaned up.

